  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice capsicum. Cut red onion and potato into bite-sized pieces.\n• Set air fryer to 200°C. Place capsicum, red onion, potato and carrot & zucchini mix in an air fryer basket. Cook for 10 minutes.\n• Remove basket and top with chermoula spice blend, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt.\n• Shake the basket, then cook until tender, a further 5-10 minutes. Cook in batches if needed. TIP: No air fryer? Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced. Prepare veggies as above. Place capsicum, red onion, potato and carrot & zucchini mix on a lined oven tray. Top with chermoula spice blend, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665ee23006fad1c07464244b-0a780bbe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665ee23006fad1c07464244b-2e2fa347.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side (cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665ee23006fad1c07464244b-ce91bd19.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between plates.\n• Top with chermoula haloumi.\n• Drizzle over garlic sauce and tear over mint to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665ee23006fad1c07464244b-50cca786.jpeg"
    }
  ]
